---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const schema={"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebApplication","name":"Labor Burden Calculator by Trade","applicationCategory":"BusinessApplication","operatingSystem":"Web","description":"Estimate loaded and productive hourly labor cost for construction and field-service trades.","offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"0","priceCurrency":"USD"},"url":Astro.url.href};
---
<Layout title="Labor Burden Calculator by Trade | Ozarbox" description="Estimate true loaded labor cost per productive hour for electricians, plumbers, HVAC technicians, carpenters and other trades.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)}></script>
<section class="tool-wrap container">
<div class="breadcrumbs"><a href={base}>Home</a> / <a href={`${base}niche/hidden-business-costs/`}>Hidden business costs</a> / Labor burden</div>
<div class="tool-head"><div class="eyebrow">Construction & field service</div><h1>Labor Burden Calculator by Trade</h1><p>Estimate the loaded cost of an employee's productive hour after payroll taxes, workers' compensation, benefits and nonproductive time.</p></div>
<div class="tool-box"><div class="form-grid">
<label>Trade<select id="trade"><option>Electrician</option><option>Plumber</option><option>HVAC technician</option><option>Carpenter</option><option>General labor</option></select></label>
<label>Base hourly wage<input id="wage" type="number" value="30" min="0" step="0.01" /></label>
<label>Payroll taxes %<input id="payroll" type="number" value="10" min="0" step="0.1" /></label>
<label>Workers' compensation %<input id="workers" type="number" value="4" min="0" step="0.1" /></label>
<label>Benefits %<input id="benefits" type="number" value="8" min="0" step="0.1" /></label>
<label>PTO / paid nonproductive time %<input id="pto" type="number" value="5" min="0" max="80" step="0.1" /></label>
</div><button id="calculate">Calculate labor burden</button><div class="result" id="result" aria-live="polite">Enter your values and tap Calculate.</div></div>
<article class="prose"><h2>What is labor burden?</h2><p>Labor burden is the cost of employing a worker beyond the base wage. A contractor who bids only on wage can understate the true cost of delivering labor.</p><h2>Formula</h2><p><strong>Burden % = payroll taxes + workers' compensation + benefits.</strong> Loaded paid-hour cost = wage × (1 + burden%). Productive-hour cost then adjusts for paid time that is not productive field time: loaded paid-hour cost ÷ (1 − nonproductive time%).</p><h2>Trade-specific use</h2><p>Use actual payroll, insurance and benefits data for the selected trade. Workers' compensation and wage assumptions can vary substantially by jurisdiction, employer and classification, so the calculator deliberately leaves those assumptions editable.</p><h2>Example</h2><p>At a $30 base wage with 10% payroll taxes, 4% workers' compensation and 8% benefits, the loaded paid-hour cost is $36.60. With 5% nonproductive time, the estimated productive-hour cost is about $38.53.</p><h2>Related tools</h2><p><a href={`${base}niche/contractor-bid-markup-calculator/`}>Contractor Bid & Markup Calculator</a> · <a href={`${base}niche/chair-hour-overhead-calculator/`}>Chair-Hour Overhead Calculator</a> · <a href={`${base}niche/accounting/`}>Accounting tools</a></p><h2>Important note</h2><p>This is a planning model. Do not treat preset percentages as legal, payroll or insurance advice. Replace them with current figures for your business and jurisdiction.</p></article>
</section>
</Layout>
<script>
const input=(id:string): HTMLInputElement => {
  const el=document.getElementById(id);
  if (!(el instanceof HTMLInputElement)) throw new Error(`Expected input: ${id}`);
  return el;
};
const select=(id:string): HTMLSelectElement => {
  const el=document.getElementById(id);
  if (!(el instanceof HTMLSelectElement)) throw new Error(`Expected select: ${id}`);
  return el;
};
const n=(id:string):number=>Number(input(id).value||0);
const money=(x:number):string=>x.toLocaleString(undefined,{style:'currency',currency:'USD',maximumFractionDigits:2});
const result=document.getElementById('result');
if (!result) throw new Error('Missing result element');
document.getElementById('calculate')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const burden=n('payroll')+n('workers')+n('benefits'); const loaded=n('wage')*(1+burden/100); const productive=n('pto')<100?loaded/(1-n('pto')/100):NaN; result.textContent=Number.isFinite(productive)?`${select('trade').value}: ${money(productive)} estimated productive-hour cost | Burden: ${burden.toFixed(1)}% | Loaded paid-hour cost: ${money(loaded)}`:'Check your inputs.';});
</script>
